    <item>
      <title>哈国油企甲烷报告成本五年141.9亿坚戈</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-market.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-market.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦生态部拟要求油气企业监测并年度申报甲烷排放，五年合规成本初算141.9亿坚戈；江布尔州一油企因环保违规被罚逾30亿坚戈。哈能源部向四家中国公司提出本地生产、技术转让与本地订单条件，并允许油气商将部分强制数字化投入用于本土IT方案。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-26-market.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中国能建与哈方探讨电网科技合作，南京之约推动地方机制化</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>落地观察</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦与中国能建就能源领域科技合作及电网建设进行探讨；中国—中亚地方合作以「南京之约」推进；中亚媒体学者赴华调研减贫经验；申请中国政府奖学金的哈方学生须参加CSCA考试。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-26-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>托卡耶夫签署总统令组建国家治理改革委员会</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-policy.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-26-policy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦总统托卡耶夫签署总统令，批准国家治理改革问题委员会组成人员；同日工业与建设部长纳加斯帕耶夫被免职。数字治理方面，国家安全委员会与数字部正调查一起公民个人数据在暗网挂牌出售的事件。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-26-policy.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>中哈在宝鸡磋商跨区域合作，产能与地方对接进入落地阶段</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-25-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-25-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <category>落地观察</category>
      <description><![CDATA[哈萨克斯坦与中国在宝鸡讨论跨区域合作，地方层面对接继续推进；中国—中亚高质量共建「一带一路」与绿色创新发展国际论坛在乌兹别克斯坦举行；哈萨克斯坦与新加坡在新加坡举办年末商务对接活动。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-25-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈国油拟剥离主权基金并赴伦交所增发两成股份</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-25-market.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-25-market.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[KMG 被建议脱离萨姆鲁克-卡泽纳并在伦敦增发至多 20% 股份；IEA 指出哈乌天然气供给压力上升、里海原油产量稳定；阿特劳一油企因环保违规被罚逾 30 亿坚戈；哈国个体经营者一年减少 15 万但产出金额上升。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-25-market.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦批准「全民建设」监督委员会名单</title>
