    <item>
      <title>成都至哈萨克斯坦JSQ捷达班列首发</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-cooperation.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-cooperation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>中哈合作</category>
      <category>金融与物流</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <description><![CDATA[成都至哈萨克斯坦JSQ捷达班列首发，为中哈汽车及装备类货物提供新的铁路通道；哈方推出大规模「人民建设」计划并强调经济社会成果，上合组织参与哈高等教育论坛，双边合作层级从中央延伸至地方与人才领域。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-22-cooperation.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦银行前十个月利润2万亿坚戈，同比减少236亿</title>
      <link>https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-logistics.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/2026-11-22-logistics.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>金融与物流</category>
      <category>政策与监管</category>
      <category>市场与产业</category>
      <description><![CDATA[2026年前10个月哈萨克斯坦银行业利润2万亿坚戈，同比减少236亿；监管拟更新贷款与存款成本计价规则，并讨论问题债务核销免征个人所得税；同期按揭规模同比增长17.2%。物流侧本期无新增班列或口岸信息。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://pleased-forestgreen-swan-56.hostingersite.com/insights/covers/2026-11-22-logistics.svg" type="image/svg+xml" length="0" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>哈萨克斯坦农业加工出口增35%，涉农投资工具与信贷税改同步推进</title>
